config CAN_CH341
	tristate "CH341-based USB-CAN adapter"
	depends on USB && CAN_DEV
	help
	  This driver adds SocketCAN support for cheap USB-CAN analyzers
	  that use a QinHeng CH341 (HL-340) USB-to-serial bridge chip
	  with a CAN transceiver.

	  These adapters identify as:
	    Bus xxx Device yyy: ID 1a86:7523 QinHeng Electronics HL-340

	  The driver talks directly to the USB device — no userspace daemon
	  or TTY line discipline is required.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called ch341_can.
